.. rst-class:: rst-columns

- UART0_TX : GP0 (edge pin)
- UART0_RX : GP1 (edge pin)
- UART0_CTS : GP2 (edge pin, not default)
- UART0_RTS : GP3 (edge pin, not default)
- SPI0_RX : GP4 (edge pin)
- SPI0_CSN : GP5 (edge pin)
- SPI0_SCK : GP6 (edge pin)
- SPI0_TX : GP7 (edge pin)
- GPIO8 : GP8 (free usable pin)
- GPIO9 : GP9 (free usable pad)
- GPIO10 : GP10 (free usable pad)
- GPIO11 : GP11 (free usable pad)
- GPIO12 : GP12 (free usable pad)
- GPIO13 : GP13 (free usable pad)
- I2C1_SDA : GP14 (edge pin)
- I2C1_SCL : GP15 (edge pin)
- I2C0_SDA : GP16 (Qwiic)
- I2C0_SCL : GP17 (Qwiic)
- GPIO18 : GP18 (free usable pad)
- GPIO19 : GP19 (free usable pad)
- GPIO20 : GP20 (free usable pad)
- GPIO21 : GP21 (free usable pad)
- PIO0 : GP22 (only ``@4mb`` and ``@16mb``)
- PWM_3A : GP22 (only ``@chipled``)
- GPIO23 : GP23 (free usable pad)
- GPIO24 : GP24 (free usable pad)
- GPIO25 : GP25 (free usable pad)
- ADC_CH0 : GP26 (edge pin)
- ADC_CH1 : GP27 (edge pin)
- ADC_CH2 : GP28 (edge pin)
- ADC_CH3 : GP29 (edge pin)
